  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><div dir=\"ltr\"><meta http-equiv=\"content-type\" content=\"text/html; charset=utf-8\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 25px; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">皆さんこんにちは！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">鳥取県出身</span><span class=\"s5\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s6\">高校</span><span class=\"s5\">2</span><span class=\"s6\">年生</span><span class=\"s5\">&nbsp;16</span><span class=\"s6\">歳</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">山口陽世（やまぐちはるよ）です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img alt=\"IMG_8178.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-22/34433_0.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">6</span><span class=\"s6\">月</span><span class=\"s5\">29</span><span class=\"s6\">日から新三期生の個人ブログとメッセージがスタートします！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">(*´</span><span class=\"s8\" style=\"font-family: NotoSansYi-Regular;\">꒳</span><span class=\"s5\">`</span><span class=\"s6\">ﾉﾉﾞﾊﾟﾁﾊﾟﾁ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">ブログを書くのは難しかったけど、唯一みなさんに自分の文章を届ける場だったので楽しいですね！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">個人ブログが始まっても自分のペースで変わらず書いていきたいと思います</span><span class=\"s9\">😆</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">#haruyotalk&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s6\">楽しみです</span><span class=\"s5\">( ¨̮ )</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">先輩方のメッセージを数名取っていたことがあるのでいつもワクワクして開いていました！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">レターなどで皆さんと初めてコミュニケーションが取れるということで楽しみでございます（</span><span class=\"s5\">*'∇'*)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">まだ何送るのかは分からないけど楽しいものにしていきますのでよろしくお願いします！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p6\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 3px; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 25px; line-height: normal; min-height: 29.8px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">6</span><span class=\"s6\">月</span><span class=\"s5\">20</span><span class=\"s6\">日は｢走り出す瞬間｣の発売記念日でしたね！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">おめでとうございます！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">全ての曲が大好きで、ずっとループして聞いていた記憶があります</span><span class=\"s5\">(^^)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">武道館や全国ツアーの映像をみながら妹とサイリウムを降ってみていました笑</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">これからもたくさん聞きます！</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img alt=\"IMG_7847.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-22/34433_1.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">最近、友達とグループ電話をしながらフォートナイトを始めました！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">難しいから諦めていたんですけど優しく教えてくれるので、分かってきました！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">建築を丁寧に教えてくれたんですけど上達したがんって言われてすごくすごく嬉しかったです</span><span class=\"s5\">(*</span><span class=\"s10\">≧</span><span class=\"s6\">ｖ≦</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">優しい友達をもって私は幸せです。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p5\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">もっと頑張ります</span><span class=\"s5\">(</span><span class=\"s11\" style=\"font-family: Thonburi;\">ง</span><span class=\"s5\">&nbsp;•̀_•́)</span><span class=\"s11\" style=\"font-family: Thonburi;\">ง</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">では、山口クイズのお時間です</span><span class=\"s5\">(^</span><span class=\"s6\">ワ</span><span class=\"s5\">^</span><span class=\"s6\">＝</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s9\">🦁</span><span class=\"s6\">私が初めて小説を全て読むことに成功した本はなんでしょう。という問題でした！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s9\">💁‍♀️</span><span class=\"s6\">正解は⑴の｢また同じ夢を見ていた｣住野よるさん</span><span class=\"s5\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s6\">です！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">ちなみに、君の膵臓を食べたいと</span><span class=\"s5\">Another</span><span class=\"s6\">は映画を観ました！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">屍人荘の殺人は観たいなと思っている映画です</span><span class=\"s5\">(^^)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">12</span><span class=\"s6\">回目の山口クイズです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">（ｼﾞｬｰｼﾞｬﾝ</span><span class=\"s9\">🎶</span><span class=\"s6\">）</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s9\">🐮</span><span class=\"s6\">最近私が</span><span class=\"s5\">1</span><span class=\"s6\">番食べたいといっているものがありますそれはどーれだ。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑴ユッケ</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑵焼き鳥</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑶ピーナッツバターパン</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑷餃子</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">どれも食べたいけども、｢</span><span class=\"s5\">1</span><span class=\"s6\">番｣はどれでしょう</span><span class=\"s9\">🤤</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">答えは</span><span class=\"s5\">3</span><span class=\"s6\">日後です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img alt=\"IMG_8180.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-22/34433_2.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">最近たくさん笑いすぎたので幸せいっぱい</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">明日はみくにちゃんです</span><span class=\"s9\">🌈</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">最後まで読んで下さりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-hei