">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">では、<ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby>クイズのお<ruby>時間<rt>じかん</rt></ruby>です</span><span class=\"s5\">(^</span><span class=\"s6\">ワ</span><span class=\"s5\">^</span><span class=\"s6\">＝</span><span class=\"s5\">)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s9\">🦁</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が<ruby>初<rt>はじ</rt></ruby>めて<ruby>小説<rt>しょうせつ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>全<rt>すべ</rt></ruby>て<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>むことに<ruby>成功<rt>せいこう</rt></ruby>した<ruby>本<rt>ほん</rt></ruby>はなんでしょう。という<ruby>問題<rt>もんだい</rt></ruby>でした！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s9\">💁‍♀️</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>正解<rt>せいかい</rt></ruby>は⑴の｢また<ruby>同<rt>おな</rt></ruby>じ<ruby>夢<rt>ゆめ</rt></ruby>を<ruby>見<rt>み</rt></ruby>ていた｣<ruby>住野<rt>すみの</rt></ruby>よるさん</span><span class=\"s5\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"s6\">です！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">ちなみに、<ruby>君<rt>きみ</rt></ruby>の<ruby>膵臓<rt>すいぞう</rt></ruby>を<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたいと</span><span class=\"s5\">Another</span><span class=\"s6\">は<ruby>映画<rt>えいが</rt></ruby>を<ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>ました！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>屍<rt>かばね</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>じん</rt></ruby><ruby>荘<rt>そう</rt></ruby>の<ruby>殺人<rt>さつじん</rt></ruby>は<ruby>観<rt>み</rt></ruby>たいなと<ruby>思<rt>おも</rt></ruby>っている<ruby>映画<rt>えいが</rt></ruby>です</span><span class=\"s5\">(^^)</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\">12</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>回<rt>かい</rt></ruby><ruby>目<rt>め</rt></ruby>の<ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby>クイズです！</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">（ｼﾞｬｰｼﾞｬﾝ</span><span class=\"s9\">🎶</span><span class=\"s6\">）</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s9\">🐮</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby><ruby>私<rt>わたし</rt></ruby>が</span><span class=\"s5\">1</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby><ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたいといっているものがありますそれはどーれだ。</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑴ユッケ</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑵<ruby>焼き鳥<rt>やきとり</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑶ピーナッツバターパン</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">⑷<ruby>餃子<rt>ぎょうざ</rt></ruby></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">どれも<ruby>食<rt>た</rt></ruby>べたいけども、｢</span><span class=\"s5\">1</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>番<rt>ばん</rt></ruby>｣はどれでしょう</span><span class=\"s9\">🤤</span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>答<rt>こた</rt></ruby>えは</span><span class=\"s5\">3</span><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>日<rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby>後<rt>ご</rt></ruby>です！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span><span class=\"s6\">┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈</span><span class=\"s7\" style=\"font-family: Charter-Roman;\">Ꙫ</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"><img alt=\"IMG_8180.jpeg\" src=\"/images/blogs/yamaguchi.haruyo/2020-06-22/34433_2.jpg\"></span></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>最近<rt>さいきん</rt></ruby>たくさん<ruby>笑<rt>わら</rt></ruby>いすぎたので<ruby>幸<rt>しあわ</rt></ruby>せいっぱい</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>明日<rt>あした</rt></ruby>はみくにちゃんです</span><span class=\"s9\">🌈</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>最後<rt>さいご</rt></ruby>まで<ruby>読<rt>よ</rt></ruby>んで<ruby>下<rt>くだ</rt></ruby>さりありがとうございました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\">では、またね</span><span class=\"s9\">🐷</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s6\"><ruby>山口<rt>やまぐち</rt></ruby><ruby>陽<rt>よう</rt></ruby><ruby>世<rt>よ</rt></ruby>でした</span><span class=\"s9\">👋🏻</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22.7px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s5\"></span><br></p></div></div>\n                    ",
